firmware_available.description:
Sent after each hello from a Device that reports firmware, and on every target change. A version equal to the running firmware means no update: discard any staged image. url, size, sha256 and signature (Ed25519, base64, over the UTF-8 message "walkieone-firmware
{board}
{version}
{sha256hex}
") travel together; without them the frame only names the target version.
